        + LAYER met2 ( -140 -1000 ) ( 140 0 )
        + PLACED ( 121220 130000 ) N ;
    - clk + NET clk + DIRECTION INPUT + USE SIGNAL
      + PORT
        + LAYER met2 ( -140 -1000 ) ( 140 0 )
        + PLACED ( 123980 130000 ) N ;
    - ena + NET ena + DIRECTION INPUT + USE SIGNAL
